<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's NSW TCorp sets 25 bln yen dual samurai.</title>
<headline>Australia's NSW TCorp sets 25 bln yen dual samurai.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>New South Wales Treasury Corp (TCorp) said on Tuesday it has issued a 25 billion yen dual currency samurai bond through Daiwa Securities.</p>
</text>
